# CHANGELOG.md is the one file every branch touches, always at the same place — the top of the
# list under "## Unreleased" — so two branches merged in parallel conflicted there every time.
# Union merge keeps both sides' bullets instead of conflicting. The file is a flat bullet list
# with no topic headings precisely so this is safe: there is no shared header line for two
# branches to both add, and a bullet that lands out of date order is left where it lands —
# the date and PR number on each entry carry the order.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
